B.bCC=new A.hu("hrv","HRV","ms",B.J,B.cv,null,null,"RMSSD over the longest artefact-free window during sleep. Beat timing is recovered from the band's 1 Hz records and corrected by the Lipponen\u2013Tarvainen method before any statistic is taken. Pulse-derived, so this is PRV: real and trendable, but not ECG HRV.","Task Force 1996 \xb7 Lipponen & Tarvainen 2019",B.oz)
